{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"繼弒君不言即位。此其言即位何？如其意也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"二、三月，公會鄭伯于垂。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"三、鄭伯以璧假許田。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"其言以璧假之何？易之也。易之則其言假之何？為恭也。曷為為恭？有天子存，則諸侯不得專地也。許田者何？魯朝宿之邑也。諸侯時朝乎天子，天子之郊，諸侯皆有朝宿之邑焉。此魯朝宿之邑也，則曷為謂之許田？諱取周田也。諱取周田則曷為謂之許田？繫之許也。曷為繫之許？近許也。此邑也，其稱田何？田多邑少稱田，邑多田少稱邑。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月丁未，公及鄭伯盟于越。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"五、秋，大水。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_12_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_12","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}